	<string>Type 2fa and part of an account name.

Return copies the current code. Command-Return copies the next code, or advances an HOTP counter and copies the new code. Option-Return pastes the current code into the front app.

Needs tess and a remembered passphrase: run tess vault remember once in a terminal.</string>
